[{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0300","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-5054","title":"Adobe Flash Player Matrix3D类整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 11.4.402.265 之前版本中的 Matrix3D 类的 copyRawDataTo 方法存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。远程攻击者可通过向受影响的 Flash Player 环境提交特制的畸形参数触发该漏洞，导致内存破坏，进而实现任意代码执行。攻击者通常利用恶意构造的 SWF 文件诱导用户访问，在用户交互条件下完成利用。该漏洞影响 Adobe Flash Player 全平台版本，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Adobe 已在 11.4.402.265 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-5054"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-09-24T17:55:07.217","updated":"2026-06-16T23:46:05.460","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 11.4.402.265 或更高版本。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持并终止分发，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并移除浏览器插件，同时禁用浏览器中所有与 Flash 相关的加载项，以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/116435/Adobe-Flash-Player-Matrix3D-Integer-Overflow-Code-Execution.html","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-19.html","http://www.vupen.com/english/services/ba-index.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/78866","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-5054","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-5054.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5054.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-5054","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2012/5xxx/CVE-2012-5054.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-5054/README_KO.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-5054.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-5054.html","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-5054","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-5054.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0222","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4969","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer execCommand 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 6至9版本的mshtml.dll组件中的CMshtmlEd::Exec函数存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。当用户访问特制网站时，攻击者可利用该漏洞触发已释放内存对象的非法引用，从而在当前用户上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞已在2012年9月被野外利用，影响范围广泛，CVSS评分8.1，危害等级高。Microsoft已在安全公告MS12-063中发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4969"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-09-18T10:39:14.147","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:58.897","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-063 提供的累积更新 KB2744842，将 Internet Explorer 升级至已修复版本（IE6~9 对应补丁）。如无法安装补丁，可启用 EMET 工具或配置 IE 安全级别为「高」并禁用 ActiveX 控件和活动脚本作为临时缓解措施。由于该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，建议优先通过 Windows Update 部署更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.vulnhunt.com/index.php/2012/09/17/ie-execcommand-fuction-use-after-free-vulnerability-0day_en/","http://dev.metasploit.com/redmine/projects/framework/repository/entry/modules/exploits/windows/browser/ie_execcommand_uaf.rb","http://eromang.zataz.com/2012/09/16/zero-day-season-is-really-not-over-yet/","http://technet.microsoft.com/security/advisory/2757760","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/480095","http://www.securitytracker.com/id?1027538","http://www.securityweek.com/new-internet-explorer-zero-day-being-exploited-wild","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-255A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-262A.html","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-265A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15729","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-4969","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21840","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4969.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4969.json","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B]UAF%20%E4%B9%8B%20CVE-2012-4969%20%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c5bad6944a5db25ea7ec6daf0fae559d8266622/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4969.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-4969.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-4969.html","https://github.com/0xeb/TheBigPromptLibrary/blob/655667d2dd43bad65f189ec49d8606bf3e8d967e/CustomInstructions/ChatGPT/knowledge/P0tS3c/UsingMetasploit.md","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/d206e936b7c9c49da608b2e68f805e3421c7432a/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-4969.csv","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2012/CVE-2012-4969.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0222.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0022","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4889","title":"ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 跨站脚本与目录遍历漏洞","description":"ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 7.2 及 8.0 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 createAnomaly.do、mindex.do、index2.do、syslogViewer.do 等页面的 subTab、tab、url、port 参数注入恶意 Web 脚本或 HTML 代码，当管理员查看日志时脚本被执行，导致敏感信息窃取。该漏洞影响 ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 全系列，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4889"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-09-10T22:55:07.413","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:51.113","remediation":"立即升级 ManageEngine Firewall Analyzer 至当前最新版本（12.8 或更高），该问题已在 7.2 之后的安全更新中修复。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器或反向代理层面配置输入校验规则，对 createAnomaly.do、mindex.do、index2.do、syslogViewer.do 等接口的 subTab、tab、url、port 参数进行严格过滤，拦截 HTML 标签和 JavaScript 关键字；同时在应用层对所有用户输入输出实施上下文相关的 HTML 编码转义，防止反射型 XSS 执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/80872","http://osvdb.org/80873","http://osvdb.org/80874","http://osvdb.org/80875","http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111474/VL-437.txt","http://secunia.com/advisories/48657","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52841","http://www.vulnerability-lab.com/get_content.php?id=437","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74538","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37032","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4889.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4889.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4889.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4889.js","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4889-2216.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/422db14aea6c90ec23ceb3c50e97ae16c76d143d/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-48xx/CVE-2012-4889.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4889.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/cve-2012-4889-2214.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2012-4889-2216.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2012-4889-2217.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4889_7.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0021","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4878","title":"FlatnuX CMS 2011 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"FlatnuX CMS 2011 08.09.2 版本的 controlcenter.php 中存在绝对路径遍历漏洞，远程管理员可通过 contents/Files 操作中的 dir 参数传入完整路径名，读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4878"],"sources":["cve","nuclei"],"published":"2012-09-06","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"将 FlatnuX CMS 升级到最新版本，或在 controlcenter.php 中对 dir 参数进行严格的路径过滤，禁止包含绝对路径和 .. 目录跳转序列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T12:48:47.726325865+00:00","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111473/Flatnux-CMS-2011-08.09.2-CSRF-XSS-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52846","http://www.vulnerability-lab.com/get_content.php?id=487","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/74568"],"poc_urls":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/111473/Flatnux-CMS-2011-08.09.2-CSRF-XSS-Directory-Traversal.html"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0208","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4681","title":"Oracle Java SE JRE 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 7 Update 6及更早版本中的Java运行时环境（JRE）组件存在安全管理器绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页，由特制Java小程序（Applet）利用com.sun.beans.finder.ClassFinder.findClass方法结合forName异常机制访问受限类（如sun.awt.SunToolkit），再通过反射调用getField方法修改私有字段，完全绕过SecurityManager安全限制，实现任意代码执行。该漏洞在2012年8月已被野外利用，影响所有安装了受影响Java版本的浏览器用户，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle官方已在后续更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4681"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-08-28T00:55:01.860","updated":"2026-06-16T23:45:34.017","remediation":"立即卸载 Java 7 Update 6 及更早版本，升级到 Oracle Java 7 Update 7 或更高版本。如业务必须使用旧版 Java，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 插件，并将 Java 安全级别设置为最高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.fireeye.com/research/2012/08/zero-day-season-is-not-over-yet.html","http://immunityproducts.blogspot.com/2012/08/java-0day-analysis-cve-2012-4681.html","http://labs.alienvault.com/labs/index.php/2012/new-java-0day-exploited-in-the-wild/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-09/msg00032.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-10/msg00016.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=135109152819176&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1225.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51044","http://www.deependresearch.org/2012/08/java-7-vulnerability-analysis.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/alert-cve-2012-4681-1835715.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/55213","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-240A.html","https://community.rapid7.com/community/metasploit/blog/2012/08/27/lets-start-the-week-with-a-new-java-0day","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-4681","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20865","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4681.md","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/dc7f7d0b488d3b9dd1a87b4deaefb31e5285739d/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Java/Exploit/CVE-2012-4681.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/WinNT/CVE-2012-4681/Exploit_WinNT_CVE-2012-4681_HG.yar","https://github.com/LyleMi/Learn-Web-Hacking/blob/7a42e3252fdcae87663434b1fd54ec89d671bfbe/source/language/java/sandbox.rst","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-4681","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-4681/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-4681.txt","https://github.com/milo2012/pentest_scripts/blob/63691e998ef4ef327b6975b69ad716fdecb80a97/mitm/msf1.rc","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-4681.html","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2012/database/CVE-2012-4681/CVE-2012-4681-Armoring-benjholla.md","https://github.com/benjholla/CVE-2012-4681-Armoring","https://github.com/ZH3FENG/PoCs-CVE_2012_4681"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0100","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1535","title":"Adobe Flash Player 字体解析远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player 11.3.300.271之前版本（Windows/Mac）及11.2.202.238之前版本（Linux）中存在未明漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含特制SWF内容的Word文档触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞源于字体解析过程中的输入验证缺陷，攻击者利用精心构造的SWF文件可完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞已在2012年8月被野外利用，影响范围广泛，CVSS评分7.8，危害等级高。Adobe官方已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1535"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-08-15T10:31:40.677","updated":"2026-06-16T23:39:42.360","remediation":"建议立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 11.3.300.271（Windows/Mac）或 11.2.202.238（Linux）及以上版本。由于 Adobe 已于 2020 年 12 月 31 日正式停止 Flash Player 支持并发布终止生命公告，根本性解决方案是彻底卸载 Flash Player，在浏览器中禁用 Flash 插件，并移除所有依赖 Flash 的应用程序。临时缓解措施包括：在组策略中禁用 Flash 执行权限，使用企业级白名单软件阻止 SWF 文件运行，以及通过杀毒软件启用针对 CVE-2012-1535 的入侵检测规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00010.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00012.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=139455789818399&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-1203.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201209-01.xml","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb12-18.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1535","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20624","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1535.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/4a810b0db2e9cab67156f722c309e925ee8f02a0/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1535.json","https://github.com/EmergingThreats/et-luajit-scripts/blob/109d050f5593e629311d0ca92d3200f59d57a7c8/CVE-2012-1535.lua","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1535","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/EFI-Demo/Endpoint-Forecasting-and-Interpreting/blob/eff05b6ccc939b8164d47884f2faf7d3e8f99eb1/CTIs/talosintelligence/talosintelligence/2012/CVE-2012-1535%20Flash%200-day%20In%20The%20Wild.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-1535.html","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/SSVC/data/2012/CVE-2012-1535.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1535.txt","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2012-1535"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0100.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0100.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0111","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1856","title":"Microsoft MSCOMCTL.OCX TabStrip ActiveX 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"MSCOMCTL.OCX 中的 TabStrip ActiveX 控件存在系统状态破坏漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制的 Office 文档或恶意网页，诱使用户打开后触发内存破坏，从而以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2003/2007/2010、SQL Server 2000/2005/2008/2008 R2、Commerce Server 2002/2007/2009、Host Integration Server 2004、Visual FoxPro 8.0/9.0 及 Visual Basic 6.0 运行时等多个产品，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。攻击需用户交互（打开文件或访问网页），但无需身份认证，攻击复杂度低。Microsoft 已于 2012 年 8 月安全公告 MS12-060 中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1856"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-08-15T01:55:01.490","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:26.290","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-060 (KB2720573) 提供的安全更新。受影响产品对应补丁：Office 2003 SP3 安装 KB2726929，Office 2007 SP2/SP3 安装 KB2687441，Office 2010 SP1 (32位) 安装 KB2597986，SQL Server 2000 SP4 安装 KB983812 (GDR) 或 KB983811 (QFE)，SQL Server 2005 SP4 安装 KB2726929，SQL Server 2008/2008 R2 安装 KB2687441，Visual Basic 6.0 Runtime 安装 KB2708437。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表设置 TabStrip ActiveX 控件 kill bit（CLSID: {1EFB6596-857C-11D1-B16A-00C0F0283628}）或在 Office 中禁用所有 ActiveX 控件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54948","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-227A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-060","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15447","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1856","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-1856.md","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2012-0158&CVE-2012-1856/CVE-2012-1856/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f0111a41156462d46f484c055bdeafa69cf38c8e/SSVC/data/2012/CVE-2012-1856.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f7fbdb78e572cf69166b06f5f222a65cac6edb53/references/CVE-2012-1856-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/decalage2/oletools/blob/ec10260989dbc48b9109e3d05d22beee19cf2333/oletools/common/clsid.py","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2012/CVE-2012-1856/README_KO.md","https://github.com/rapid7/dap/blob/38bd19d0906183aaa896b55fa3ab756a6254da84/data/vulndb.rb","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1856.txt","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-1856.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2012/POC-AVE-2012-0111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2012/EXP-AVE-2012-0111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0010","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1835","title":"Timely All-in-One Event Calendar 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 All-in-One Event Calendar 插件 1.4 及 1.5 版本中存在多处反射型跨站脚本漏洞。由于多个参数（包括 title、args、before_title、after_title、button_value 及 msg）在输出前未进行充分的过滤与转义处理，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 URL 诱使用户点击，从而在用户浏览器中执行任意 HTML 或 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响使用该插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1835"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-14T21:55:00.923","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:23.640","remediation":"升级 All-in-One Event Calendar 插件至 1.6 及以上版本，该版本已修复了对 title、msg、args、button_value 等参数的输入过滤缺陷。如无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台停用该插件，并通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）对查询参数中 <script> 等关键字进行拦截作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2012-04/0071.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/52986","https://www.htbridge.com/advisory/HTB23082","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37077","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1835.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-1835.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-1835.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-1835.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/6001-to-7000-templates/cve-2012-1835-2172.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1835","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2012/CVE-2012-1835.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2012-1835-2173.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/20