026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/112658/WordPress-WP-FaceThumb-Gallery-0.1-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49143","http://wordpress.org/support/topic/plugin-wp-facethumb-reflected-xss-vulnerability-cwe-79","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/15/12","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2012/05/16/1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53497","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37155","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-2371.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-2371.js","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2012/CVE-2012-2371.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2371.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2012-2371-2177.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-2371_1.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2012-2371-2175.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2012-2371-2175.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2012-2371-768a12a075bfd3e1bc707162b718c0d5.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0017","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4253","title":"MySQLDumper 多个目录遍历漏洞","description":"MySQLDumper 1.24.4 存在多处目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向 learn/cubemail/install.php 的 language 参数或 learn/cubemail/filemanagement.php 的 f 参数注入 `../` 路径遍历序列，可读取服务器上的任意文件；或向 learn/cubemail/menu.php 的 config 参数注入 `../` 序列，可执行任意本地文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入路径进行充分过滤，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4253"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-08-13T18:55:05.740","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:42.823","remediation":"由于 MySQLDumper 1.24.4 已无官方维护且无后续版本修复，建议手动修改受影响 PHP 文件：在 learn/cubemail/install.php 中对 language 参数、learn/cubemail/filemanagement.php 中对 f 参数、learn/cubemail/menu.php 中对 config 参数，添加 basename() 或 realpath() 路径过滤，禁止包含 ../ 等目录遍历序列。同时通过 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）或 WAF 添加规则，拦截包含 ../ 及空字节编码的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/112304/MySQLDumper-1.24.4-LFI-XSS-CSRF-Code-Execution-Traversal.html","http://www.osvdb.org/81609","http://www.osvdb.org/81615","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53306","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75283","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/75286","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37129","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2012/CVE-2012-4253.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/efa56541ba84ae91eb0da267c473426b115491e2/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2012-4253.js","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/422db14aea6c90ec23ceb3c50e97ae16c76d143d/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-42xx/CVE-2012-4253.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2012-4253.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4253_34.yaml","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2023/Mar/05/Reports/lfiReport.csv","https://github.com/v1asdcv/DDDD-/blob/26176d9f6a7e7eb9d549f38939cba88b9e54e63f/common/config/workflow.yaml","https://github.com/sailuh/perceive/blob/85ca622832e25fa91d8d836b8c93a096178bb35d/Notebooks/NVD/data/2012.csv","https://github.com/jmoraissec/openasm/blob/f3b38a4502d7a16b760f8965b2b5a9e94d3a914d/nuclei-templates/infra/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4253.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0015","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-4032","title":"WebsitePanel 登录页面开放重定向漏洞","description":"WebsitePanel（Windows 服务器管理面板）登录页面 Default.aspx 存在开放重定向漏洞。攻击者可通过在 ReturnUrl 参数中构造恶意 URL，诱使用户点击后跳转到任意外部网站，进而实施钓鱼攻击。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的 ReturnUrl 参数进行充分验证，影响 WebsitePanel 1.2.2.1 之前的所有版本。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分 5.8，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-4032"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-07-17T21:55:02.583","updated":"2026-06-16T23:44:18.527","remediation":"升级 WebsitePanel 至 1.2.2.1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ReturnUrl 参数未校验跳转目标的问题。如无法升级，在反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 层面对 Default.aspx 的 ReturnUrl 参数实施白名单校验，仅允许跳转到本站域名内地址。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://osvdb.org/83689","http://packetstormsecurity.org/files/114541/WebsitePanel-CMS-Open-Redirect.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49813","http://websitepanel.codeplex.com/workitem/224","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/54346","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/76803","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/37488","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-4032.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/0c7acbe01d12e3db33eedacb7a2c97c0d518fac0/http/cves/2012/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bf570d3b8e47bf0003b46684217cf02c76e2c7f4/cves/2012/4xxx/CVE-2012-4032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-4032","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4032_1.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2012-4032.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2012-4032_6.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2012-4032_2.yaml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/8916c231213b31bc2afad1cbbe3753ce4d817960/api/2012/CVE-2012-4032.json","https://github.com/lucacapacci/pocs/blob/9aacbdfa8e3d43186bb2335e317c74fdeb4a88a9/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-4032.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0109","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1854","title":"Microsoft Visual Basic for Applications 不安全库加载权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft Visual Basic for Applications (VBA) 的 VBE6.dll 组件存在不可信搜索路径漏洞（CWE-426）。当用户通过 Microsoft Office 2003 SP3、2007 SP2/SP3、2010 Gold/SP1 等受影响版本打开包含恶意 DLL 文件的目录中的 .docx 文档时，VBE6.dll 会优先从当前工作目录而非系统路径加载库文件。本地攻击者可将特制木马 DLL 放置在包含 Office 文档的目录中，诱使用户打开该文档即可触发 DLL 劫持，从而在用户权限上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞在 2012 年 7 月已被野外利用，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1854"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-07-10T21:55:05.587","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:25.993","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS12-046 提供的更新：Office 2003 SP3 安装 KB2687626，Office 2007 SP2/SP3 安装 KB2596744，Office 2010/SP1 安装 KB2598243 和 KB2553447，VBA 运行时安装 KB2688865。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 下载中心手动安装。临时缓解措施：禁用 WebClient 服务，在防火墙层面阻止 TCP 139/445 端口，或使用 KB2264107 工具禁用从远程网络共享加载库。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA12-192A.html","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2012/ms12-046","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14950","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/SecurityBulletins/2012/ms12-046","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2012-1854","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f5661b9e41f1492ce39335948/cves/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1854.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-1854","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a538bd81432b918b342e413f43256da1f80b6c0d/2012/1xxx/CVE-2012-1854.json","https://github.com/elementalsouls/Claude-BugHunter/blob/4b6c6a525169df4cc5b3353257393ffd7b57e455/docs/cve-coverage.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2012-1854.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2012-1854.md","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-ai-security-hub/blob/13403e1745f63237e7ef6d51562fb36112320d77/frontend/cve/CVE-2012-1854.html","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/730547e3121e93fb4d300346c9d4aa5d5b39b4fc/data_single/2012/CVE-2012-1854.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-77fm-4w36-vpp3/GHSA-77fm-4w36-vpp3.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/df98cd885e49b66ef39b05ac11ddad1b492edabf/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0012","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-2122","title":"The user wants me to generate a title field for CVE-2012-2122 following the format \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" in Chinese. From the known information: - Vendor: Oracle MySQL / MariaDB - Product: MySQL / MariaDB - Vulnerability type: 身份认证绕过 (Authentication Bypass) The format should be: \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\" So: \"Oracle MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞\" - but this is too similar to the original title. Let me think about what's more accurate. The vulnerability is in MySQL (by Oracle) and MariaDB, where authentication can be bypassed due to a memcmp issue. The original title mentions \"MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞\". Following the format strictly: \"Oracle MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞\" seems appropriate. But I could also be more descriptive. Let me think - the format is \"厂商 产品 漏洞类型\": - 厂商: Oracle (MySQL) / MariaDB... but primarily Oracle MySQL - 产品: MySQL (also affects MariaDB) - 漏洞类型: 身份认证绕过 So: \"Oracle MySQL 身份认证绕过漏洞\" Or maybe: \"Oracle MySQL 及 MariaDB 身份认证绕过漏洞\" to be more comprehensive about affected products. Actually, looking at the example \"Microsoft Windows TCP","description":"tags.<value>MySQL 及 MariaDB 的 sql/password.c 中存在身份认证绕过漏洞。由于某些平台上 memcmp() 函数返回值在隐式转换为 int 类型时存在截断问题，当非零返回值的低字节恰好为零时，密码比对会错误地判定为成功。远程攻击者无需有效凭据，只需反复使用同一错误密码向目标数据库服务器发起认证请求，平均约 256 次尝试即可绕过身份验证，获得目标数据库的完全访问权限。该漏洞影响 Oracle MySQL 5.1.x 至 5.6.x 系列及 MariaDB 5.1.x 至 5.5.x 系列特定版本，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害评级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2012-2122"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2012-06-26T18:55:05.083","updated":"2026-06-16T23:41:02.110","remediation":"升级 MySQL 至 5.1.63/5.5.24/5.6.6 及以上版本，或升级 MariaDB 至 5.1.62/5.2.12/5.3.6/5.5.23 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在 MySQL 配置中增加 `max_connect_errors=10000` 并启用 `skip_name_resolve` 以降低暴力重试认证的成功率，同时限制数据库端口的网络访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.mysql.com/bug.php?id=64884","http://kb.askmonty.org/en/mariadb-5162-release-notes/","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2012-08/msg00007.html","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2012/q2/493","http://secunia.com/advisories/49417","http://secunia.com/advisories/53372","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201308-06.xml","http://securitytracker.com/id?1027143","http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19092","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/53911","https://community.rapid7.com/community/metasploit/blog/2012/06/11/cve-2012-2122-a-tragically-comedic-security-flaw-in-mysql","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19092","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2012/CVE-2012-2122.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2012/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/e6476fc6772c1bcd2d758cd76795da7d9a90c80c/mysql/CVE-2012-2122/README.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/MySQL%20%E8%BA%AB%E4%BB%BD%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/mysql/CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/ce14b54e9cc4d6f7db4ad24bbd8c2864f1be855b/data/2012/CVE-2012-2122-zhangkaibin0921_CVE-2012-2122.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2012/CVE-2012-2122","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2012/CVE-2012-2122.json","https://github.com/cldrn/nmap-nse-scripts/blob/68ef7247cfd0af228e76b5dc82d16bf87eee0f6e/scripts/mysql-vuln-cve2012-2122.nse","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/dabd751ebee99e2986a17e0dd685d32ee33f3524/specs/m/mysql8.4/mysql8.4.spec","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Avinza/CVE-2012-2122-scanner","https://github.com/cyberharsh/Oracle-mysql-CVE-2012-2122","https://github.com/zhangkaibin0921/CVE-2012-2122","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2012-2122","https://github.com/subinyy/docker_CVE_2012_2122"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2012/AVE-2012-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2012-0108","file_name":"2012/AVE-2012-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2012-1723","title":"Oracle Java SE Hotspot 组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle Java SE 的 Hotspot 组件中存在一个未明漏洞，远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意网页或运行特制的 Java Applet 小程序触发该漏洞。由于字节码验证器缓存处理不当，攻击者能够绕过 Java 沙箱安全限制，在目标系统上执行任意代码，完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞影响 Java SE 7 Update 4 及更早版本、6 Update 32 及更早版本、5 Update 35 及更早版本以及 1.4.2_37 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle 已在 2012 年 6 月的关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2012-1723"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2012-06-16T21:55:03.500","updated":"2026-06-16T23:40:10.777","remediation":"升级 Oracle Java SE 至 7u5、6u33、5u36 或 1.4.2_38 及以上版本，或安装 Oracle 官方 2012 年 6 月 Critical Patch Update (CPU)。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 Java Applet 插件，或通过控制面板将 Java 安全级别设为最高。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail.openjdk.java.net/pipermail/distro-pkg-dev/2012-June/019076.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=134496371727681&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2012-0734.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/51080","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-201406-32.xml","http://www.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21615246","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2012:095","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics